    "i_en": "Model one of your own values with a short story: when did you put it ahead of your comfort? Then show the difference between 'I value honesty' (talk) and 'I told the truth though it cost me' (a value). A value is an action, not a slogan.",
    "off_en": "Write the four steps on the board."
