    "i_en": "Circulate and turn every 'don't' into 'we commit to'. Push them from vague to visible: what does this norm mean when we see it in class? Each group comes out with two or three worded norms to feed the class charter.",
    "m_en": "Blank norm cards, the value cards for reference, pens",
    "a_en": "For younger students: give ready norms to choose and vote on, instead of wording from scratch.",
