    "m_ar": "بطاقات الأماني المطبوعة (مجموعة لكل فريق)، بطاقات الخطة الفارغة (بطاقة لكل طالب)، أقلام، بطاقة الرصد",
    "lead_en": "Objective: a student can turn a wish into a first step small enough to finish in one day, pin it to a time and place, and name a witness they will tell.",
    "checks_en": [
     "Turns the wish into an action step",
     "The step fits in a single day",
     "Pins the step to a time and place",
     "Helps a classmate shrink their step"
    ],
    "i_en": "Read this ten minutes before the session. The most common failure is a goal disguised as a step: “I will learn to code” is not a step; “I open lesson one tonight after dinner at my desk” is. Repeat the shrinking question until they know it by heart: can it be done in one day? If not, shrink it.",
    "m_en": "Printed wish cards (one set per team), blank plan cards (one per student), pens, the observation card"
