    "statement_en": "Think of a group you were in…\nthat could not decide, until someone gave up.",
    "questions_en": [
     "What did you end up doing?",
     "Who decided in the end — and how?"
    ],
    "i_en": "Take 4-5 answers. The second question exposes the lesson: in most stories someone “decided” by volume or by exhaustion, not by reason. Do not name that yet — let the explanation do it.",
