    "i_en": "Give step two the most time — it is the one always skipped. Act out the difference: a group arguing “trip or party?” for ten minutes, then a group asking first “what matters: that everyone can join? or that it is cheap?” and settling it in two. Step four is hard for everyone — say so plainly.",
    "off_en": "Write the four steps on the board."
